# Cached OHLCV parquet (any depth): the M31 baseline is pinned separately
# under data/pinned/ with hash + provenance; everything else is a cache
# that scripts may regenerate (P0, F-05 — was data/ohlcv/ES/1d.parquet).
data/ohlcv/**/*.parquet
# Intraday sample fixtures: regenerable, no tracked test reads them.
data/intraday/

# Experiment artifacts — search runs write their own SQLite store per round
