# Data lake bars: 2.7 GB, rebuildable from the 1m parquet via
# scripts/resample_lake.py.
data/lake/**/*.parquet
# Lake metadata is MACHINE STATE (P0, F-05b): coverage/lineage/ingestion
# JSONs are rewritten on every ingestion run and were previously tracked,
# producing constant git churn and misleading diffs.  The lake's shape
# stays reviewable via `uv run python scripts/lake_status.py` and the
# audit test (tests/unit/test_lake_metadata_audit.py).
# NB: data/lake/plans/*.conf stays TRACKED — it is a human-edited backfill
# plan (config), not machine state.
data/lake/metadata/

# Raw downloaded source data (557 MB+, re-downloadable via SimFin API key):
data/simfin/
# Lane B screening run outputs (regenerable via scripts/run_lane_b_screen.py):
data/lane-b/

# Pinned datasets (track for reproducibility — see data/pinned/*provenance.json)
!data/pinned/

# trading-os study material (2026-08-19): keep the distilled study notes
# (INDEX/NOTES/TASKS/DOMANDE/RISPOSTE), ignore the bulky raw sources:
# 729MB of cloned third-party repos and 31MB of video transcripts,
# re-downloadable from their origins. edge_cookies.txt = browser session
# cookies, never commit.
trading-os/knowledge/moondev-repos/*/
trading-os/video-library/transcripts/
trading-os/video-library/edge_cookies.txt
